# race-gp-cup: a whole Grand Prix cup PLAYED to its ending (plan S6:
# the GP ending reached by play, not by [debug] force_mode).
# Needs --ini debug.autodrive=1 (the CPU drives player 1 through all six
# races) and a big log: --ini debug.filelog_max_kb=65536 (the default
# 4 MB cap stops the guest log mid-cup and the run cannot see its end).
# Ticks 0-3299: race-gp-finish's walk (GP, NOVICE, JACK cup, 30 machines).
# Then A every 300 ticks: it is masked off racer 0 in a race (autodrive)
# and walks every post-race screen (lap times, results, total ranking,
# next-course card 0x0F, GP next machine 0x12). Measured mode timeline
# (det=1, N3DS lane): races at 3240 12360 21060 28860 37860 47760
# (Mute City .. Big Blue), GP_END_CS (0x11) at 56220: results scroll,
# total ranking, podiums, Thanks for playing; the A at 61200 leaves it
# for the main menu (0x07) at 61380. The run ends at 61800.
# SHOTs hand-placed: every 1000 ticks of the cup, every 100 over the
# last race's results and the whole ending.
build ni-strict-census@bbd92ab
seed1 0x1234abcd
seed2 0x0fedcba9
pins renderthread=0 det=1 autodrive=1
at 400
press START 15 0
at 800
press A 15 0
at 1100
